@startuml usecase-03-Combat
' ③ 실시간 전투 — 조작 · 피격 · 상태이상
title ③ 실시간 전투 — 유스케이스

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "플레이어" as Player
actor "적 AI" as EnemyAI <<시스템>>
actor "보스" as Boss <<시스템>>
actor "게임 시스템" as GameSys <<시스템>>
Boss -|> EnemyAI

rectangle "실시간 전투 (Entities · Control · Characters)" {
  usecase "이동\n(Physics · PlayerPilot)" as UC_Move
  usecase "점프\n(JumpState)" as UC_Jump
  usecase "평타 콤보\n(BasicAttackCombo · AttackState)" as UC_Basic
  usecase "공중 공격\n(AerialAttackState)" as UC_Aerial
  usecase "대시\n(Physics)" as UC_Dash
  usecase "대시 패리\n(DefenseWindows · Combat.TryParry)" as UC_Parry
  usecase "고유 스킬 사용 (Z)\n(Ally.UniqueSkill)" as UC_Unique
  usecase "타격 판정\n(Attack · Combat.Attack)" as UC_HitCheck
  usecase "피격 처리 — 상태 전이\n(Combat.Hit · CombatStateRules)" as UC_Hit
  usecase "넉백 · 띄우기 · 벽 바운드\n(Combat.Impact · Physics · WallFinder)" as UC_Knock
  usecase "상태이상 — 스턴 · 빙결 · 속박\n(StatusEffects · StatusRules)" as UC_Status
  usecase "보스 가드 브레이크\n(GuardMeter)" as UC_Guard
  usecase "사망\n(Combat.Die · DeadState)" as UC_Die
}

Player --> UC_Move
Player --> UC_Jump
Player --> UC_Basic
Player --> UC_Dash
Player --> UC_Unique

UC_Aerial .> UC_Basic : <<extend>>
UC_Parry .> UC_Dash : <<extend>>
UC_Basic .> UC_HitCheck : <<include>>
UC_Unique .> UC_HitCheck : <<include>>

UC_HitCheck <-- EnemyAI
UC_Hit <-- GameSys
UC_Knock <-- GameSys
UC_Status <-- GameSys
UC_Die <-- GameSys
UC_Guard <-- Boss

UC_HitCheck .> UC_Hit : <<include>>
UC_Hit .> UC_Knock : <<include>>
UC_Status .> UC_Hit : <<extend>>
UC_Guard .> UC_Hit : <<extend>>
UC_Die .> UC_Hit : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC_Basic
  평타 적중은 ④ "자동 카드 발동"의 계기가 된다.
end note
@enduml
